  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C → F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F → C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1b2e;\n  --card: #2a2640;\n  --accent: #ffd166;\n  --text: #f4f1ff;\n  --muted: #9a94b8;\n  --border: #ffd166;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: #1a1729;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\ninput:hover, select:hover { background: #241f38; }\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1e1b2e;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ffe08a; }\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000;\n}\n.result-wrap {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  padding-top: 16px;\n  border-top: 3px dashed var(--muted);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n#result {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  word-break: break-all;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 20px 16px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #000; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var input = document.getElementById('temperature');\n  var direction = document.getElementById('direction');\n  var button = document.getElementById('convert');\n  var result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function convert(value, dir) {\n    if (dir === 'c-to-f') {\n      return value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    }\n    return (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n\n  function run() {\n    var raw = input.value.trim();\n    if (raw === '') {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    var num = Number(raw);\n    if (!isFinite(num)) {\n      result.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n    }\n    var out = convert(num, direction.value);\n    result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  button.addEventListener('click', run);\n  input.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      run();\n    }\n  });\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny, offline temperature converter with a pixel-inspired look. No packages, no network requests, no storage — just HTML, CSS and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature number in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - **Celsius → Fahrenheit**\n   - **Fahrenheit → Celsius**\n4. Press **Convert** (or hit Enter in the input).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no unit suffix.\n\nEmpty or invalid/non-finite input displays `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and labeled controls\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed, responsive styling\n- `script.js` — conversion and validation logic\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have associated `<label>` elements.\n- Visible focus, hover and pressed states.\n- Works down to 360px wide screens.\n\n## Notes\n\nEverything runs locally. There are no external assets, imports or server requirements.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
